{'symbol': 'TFX', 'date': '2023-06-06 06:30:00', 'title': 'TELEFLEX ANNOUNCES THE ARROW® EZ-IO® NEEDLE IS NOW FDA CLEARED FOR USE IN AN MRI ENVIRONMENT', 'text': 'WAYNE, PA., JUNE 06, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TELEFLEX INCORPORATED (NYSE: TFX), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF MEDICAL DEVICES FOR CRITICAL CARE AND SURGERY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE ARROW® EZ-IO® NEEDLE IS THE FIRST AND ONLY INTRAOSSEOUS (IO) NEEDLE TO RECEIVE 510(K) CLEARANCE FROM THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) FOR MR CONDITIONAL LABELING. THE EZ-IO® NEEDLE, A CRITICAL COMPONENT OF THE ARROW® EZ-IO® INTRAOSSEOUS VASCULAR ACCESS SYSTEM, HAS A PATENTED DIAMOND TIP DESIGNED FOR FAST,1 PRECISE AND STEADY INSERTION.'}